    "findings": [
      "All three original paintings, full native-size composition and four-row plate sheet inspected. Red sandstone, sparse cacti and a continuous flat central runway establish the intended family; native size is 1672 by 941 with no upscaling.",
      "MID repeats distant mesa walls already present in FAR. The duplicate contour creates a conspicuous pasted or terraced band behind the stands, with an abrupt depth-scale shift across the center.",
      "NEAR contributes a second shallow rock/soil band with a visible horizontal color/texture seam. Tiny magenta remnants remain at shrub tips. These visual holds remain even if the exact delivery contract passes."
    ],
    "scope": "Full-size image inspection only; no native film, player occlusion, acceptance or device qualification."
